e the pinkish purple lighting that goes up the white walls for a posh look. The bar area is off to the side in a separate room with couches for additional seating. I like that its slightly separate from the main room and set up for intimate socializing, much different than the grand room set up for a band and dancing. Their bartender..."},{"business_id":"bYP9uZWnj-eDFZcmbujLAQ","review_id":"SHGdYl6E99tqjt-WfoiSew","date":"2014-09-12T16:35:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9219713807106018,"text_excerpt":"I've been to The Cannery for a few weddings and events and I have to say this space is great. I would highly suggest this space if you have 100-300 people, once an event starts getting into the 400s parking starts to get hairy and it is hard to move around the venue. This is a great space for a wedding reception!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
